      <activity id="e7495e1f-b9d2-515c-8362-b4af2024cc5e" activityNameId="b1f59814-5128-5515-8236-3c3ab2da47e3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electronics scrap, for precious metal recovery, at preparation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electronics scrap, for precious metal recovery, at preparation plant
The multioutput-process "treatment PWB for further metallugical treatment" delivers the co-products "disposal, treatment of printed wiring boards” and "electronics scrap, for precious metal recovery, at preparation plant". The allocation is done 100% to the disposal process.;
UUID: e2939899-4c9a-4f8b-9e64-886aec8b4dd6
This dataset represents the treatment of printed wiring boards (PWB) from electric and electronic devices for the recovery of precious metals in a metallurgical process. It includes infrastructure, energy consumption, and an estimation of the efforts for transportation. The process has no emissions to air / water.
Location: Estimation - used as global average data.
Technology: Weighting, shredding and sampling of Printed Wiring Boards in a current preparation plant.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information &amp; own estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e2939899-4c9a-4f8b-9e64-886aec8b4dd6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
